, "avatar": "2aab074e337d09b965f0fdba14449cf717a81463"}, "language": "english", "review": "relaxing game", "timestamp_created": 1763243098, "timestamp_updated": 1763243098, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209325647", "author": {"steamid": "76561199814016497", "personaname": "Da_Goof_Rocker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199814016497/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4466, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3924, "last_played": 1765649910, "avatar": "cfd168ab8bc6048d80ac315e556908356f08d117"}, "language": "english", "review": "wylder is my hear me out\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1763241362, "timestamp_updated": 1763241362, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.487179487943649292", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209323160", "author": {"steamid": "76561198962433793", "personaname": "Sambokezai", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sambokezai/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 29319, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 5794, "playtime_at_review": 3004, "last_played": 1791151587, "avatar": "d4371bdba4c8c3484bc5b88edc6ee3c15d2bc250"}, "language": "english", "review": "skill required ahead", "timestamp_created": 1763239521, "timestamp_updated": 1764526627, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209319274", "author": {"steamid": "76561197977800711", "personaname": "Gunstling", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197977800711/", "num_games_owned": 363, "num_reviews": 127, "playtime_forever": 9747, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9747, "last_played": 1752106821, "avatar": "7754d99565fc06b4278785866eb6fd2e052e3b21"}, "language": "english", "review": "Your Nightreign experience will entirely demand on who you play with. There's a lot of fun and potential here, but I also feel like FromSoft missed the mark pretty hard. They leaned very heavily on Elden Ring (kinds makes sense) when they really should have leaned into past games for enemies and bosses. I wish I could leave a neutral review, because I think with some work this game could be beyond excellent.\n\nThe randomization can be rough, if you need a certain element for a boss the map might literally spawn nothing you need, but bosses are also manageable without their weakness....so net neutral?\n\nThe only option for \"builds\" are relics and in-game dropped weapons. There is some fantastic potential...but you get so many bad or contradictory relics they your inventory is flooded. The filters available to sort them are also bad...but you can grind them all up for currency to buy gacha packs of new relics for a very reasonable cost. So...net neutral?\n\nThe new bosses are [I]amazing[/i]. I love them. Even the madness goat, though his fight is nonsense at times. I would take an entirely game centered around the centaur alone, I love him. However, getting to practice them depends on getting decent drops and making it to the end of night two which can largely depend on your teammates. Personally, I have a learning impairment so I tend to need more than a few runs on a boss to figure it out. For me personally, this is a net neutral.\n\nThe game is a live-service game. It is ostensibly a good one, FromSoft has been listening to and implement feedback which is great, but the new DLC is advertising only two new character and two new bosses...which is bad unless there are more bosses they aren't telling us about? Too many unknowns with this one, they have shown to be acting in good faith at least, so this is a net good but with caution.\n\nGameplay and mechanics are pretty solid, some movement and traversal issues but the sprinting mechanic is a godsend. Overall, net good here.\n\nAnd we finally get a comprehensive story, but with an asterix. You need to complete each characters personal story/quest to get the full story, which is fair and we get some actual cutscenes. Nice. Downside is some of them need to beat the final boss to finish their story so if you're not good with one of the characters off to YouTube you go. I get it, but still net neutral to me.\n\nOverally, I recommend it, I think it is heading in the right direction, but there's a lot of caution with this optimism.", "timestamp_created": 1763236764, "timestamp_updated": 1763236764, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209316688", "author": {"steamid": "76561199094531479", "personaname": "crizzmo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199094531479/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 6997, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6777, "last_played": 1763656599, "avatar": "40572e008c3adb0ce164ad479aee94b5854ef3ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun souls like game to play whit friends. So many funny moments and 1000 of memories made.", "timestamp_created": 1763234908, "timestamp_updated": 1763234908, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209314808", "author": {"steamid": "76561199836664756", "personaname": "Lark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199836664756/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1123, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 708, "last_played": 1778368378, "avatar": "91a8ac1742af17dd714331a14a1ef8b6d86c4aef"}, "language": "english", "review": "randoms playrs are amizing", "timestamp_created": 1763233654, "timestamp_updated": 1763233654, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.487179487943649292", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209313083", "author": {"steamid": "76561198143747060", "personaname": "Apocha", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198143747060/", "num_games_owned": 334, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 16884, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12689, "last_played": 1781743605, "avatar": "8660ac4770980a535f630f8a8fd6a7e5826e1c85"}, "language": "english", "review": "rain at night :D", "timestamp_created": 1763232494, "timestamp_updated": 1763232494, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "prim